Modifications made by this project (v4):
  - QLoRA fine-tuning (r=32, alpha=64) on a pentest / bug-bounty instruction dataset
    (425 rows, 100% with distilled reasoning traces in Qwen3 think format)
  - Adapter merged into the base weights, converted to GGUF and quantized to Q4_K_M
  - Custom system prompt giving the model the HuntressQwen3 identity plus compact
    few-shot constraint examples

